# Copy to .dev.vars (untracked) to run the staging E2E suite.
#
# The E2E suite mints a REAL Clerk session token through the Clerk Frontend API, which is the
# same public sign-in flow the iOS app uses. It needs the publishable key (public by design) and
# a test user's credentials -- NOT the sk_test_ backend secret.
E2E_TARGET="https://aia-findings-staging.<your-subdomain>.workers.dev"
CLERK_FRONTEND_API="https://advanced-tetra-5.clerk.accounts.dev"
CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY="pk_test_..."
E2E_CLERK_IDENTIFIER="you+test001@example.com"
E2E_CLERK_PASSWORD="..."
